烽火","description":"元素戰技<color=#FFD780FF>流火劍</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":{"addTalentExtraLevel":{"talentType":"AvatarSkill","talentIndex":2,"extraLevel":3}},"icon":"UI_Talent_U_PlayerFire_01"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":54,"name":"燎灼的烈火","description":"施放元素爆發<color=#FFD780FF>灼火燎原</color>後，旅行者獲得20%<color=#FF9999FF>火元素傷害加成</color>，持續9秒。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_PlayerFire_03"},"4":{"id":4,"talentId":55,"name":"不滅的薪火","description":"元素爆發<color=#FFD780FF>灼火燎原</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":{"addTalentExtraLevel":{"talentType":"AvatarSkill","talentIndex":9,"extraLevel":3}},"icon":"UI_Talent_U_PlayerFire_02"},"5":{"id":5,"talentId":56,"name":"永燃的聖火","description":"處於夜魂加持狀態下時，旅行者的普通攻擊、重擊與下落攻擊將轉為具有夜魂性質且無法被附魔覆蓋的<color=#FF9999FF>火元素傷害</color>，且這些攻擊的暴擊傷害提升40%。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_PlayerFire_04","advancedProps":[{"name":"Flame Wave","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":{"tag":{"span":null,"text":"Flame Wave"},"type":{"span":null,"text":"2.5s/3 Hits"}},"interruptionResistance":"15","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]}},"dictionary":{"talent":["N10050001"],"constellation":[],"effectsInfo":{"N10050001":{"id":10050001,"name":"額外強化效果","description":"每與一種元素進行過共鳴，旅行者便會獲得對應的屬性提升：\\n<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素</color>：暴擊率提升10%。\\n<color=#FFE699FF>岩元素</color>：防禦力提升20%。\\n<color=#FFACFFFF>雷元素</color>：元素充能效率提升20%。\\n<color=#99FF88FF>草元素</color>：元素精通提升60點。\\n<color=#80C0FFFF>水元素</color>：生命值提升20%。\\n<color=#FF9999FF>火元素</color>：攻擊力提升20%。\\n<color=#99FFFFFF>冰元素</color>：暴擊傷害提升20%。","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]}}}}}